    the panel can show it for copying (useful when no browser opens or the
    analyst wants another browser profile). The wait can be aborted with
    ``cancel_sign_in()``. Only a callback carrying this attempt's ``state`` ends
    the wait; stray or stale requests to the loopback port are answered and ignored.
    The credential lock is *not* held while waiting, so analysis keeps working.
