"""Small, local-only configuration foundation for the plugin.

Authentication is browser sign-in only:

* ``chatgpt`` - Sign in with ChatGPT (OAuth in the system browser, uses the
  analyst's ChatGPT plan; tokens DPAPI-protected, see ``llm/chatgpt.py``);
* ``claude``  - Sign in with Claude through Anthropic's official CLI
  (``ant auth login``; see ``llm/claude_signin.py``).

There are no API keys. Configuration files written by older versions still
load: API-key, base-URL and Gemini/OpenAI-compatible fields are accepted but
ignored (and dropped on the next save), and an old ``gemini``/``openai``
provider value falls back to ChatGPT with a note.
"""

